WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.960 --> 00:00:02.538
(bright music)

00:00:02.538 --> 00:00:04.171
- [Narrator] In the
southern part of Croatia,

00:00:04.171 --> 00:00:06.440
in the peninsula of Peljesac,

00:00:06.440 --> 00:00:10.607
there is a winemaker that does
things a little differently.

00:00:15.519 --> 00:00:16.469
- [Narrator] That's right.

00:00:16.469 --> 00:00:19.229
This winery ages their wine 75 feet

00:00:19.229 --> 00:00:21.229
beneath the sea's surface.

00:00:23.417 --> 00:00:25.278
(playful music)

00:00:25.278 --> 00:00:28.051
After growing up around
many traditional winemakers,

00:00:28.051 --> 00:00:31.549
Edi had an idea to combine
his two favorite pastimes:

00:00:31.549 --> 00:00:34.240
Scuba diving and drinking wine.

00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:37.990
So he decided to try
and age wine in the sea.

00:00:45.748 --> 00:00:47.040
- [Narrator] To avoid any leaks in these

00:00:47.040 --> 00:00:49.880
ancient storage jars,
Edi uses a glass bottle

00:00:49.880 --> 00:00:53.369
to keep the wine in and saltwater out.

00:00:53.369 --> 00:00:56.179
He uses custom-made cages
that line the sea floor

00:00:56.179 --> 00:00:58.346
to hold the wine in place.

00:01:36.520 --> 00:01:38.299
- [Narrator] And to Edi, it's the silence

00:01:38.299 --> 00:01:39.789
that differentiates his unique

00:01:39.789 --> 00:01:42.289
underwater wine from the pack.

00:02:28.187 --> 00:02:31.020
(electronic beep)

